@startuml
' Successful execution of task.mark T001; task.unmark uses markTaskIncomplete.
hide footbox

actor User
participant ":CommandHandler" as CH
participant ":ProjectManager" as PM
participant "t:Task" as T
participant ":Ui" as UI

User -> CH : execute("task.mark T001")
activate CH
note right of CH : CommandParser routing and\nseparator output are omitted.
CH -> CH : handleTaskMark("T001")
activate CH
CH -> PM : markTaskComplete("T001")
activate PM
PM -> PM : getTask("T001")
activate PM
note right of PM : Searches active projects' tasks.\nReturns the task with ID T001.
PM --> PM : t
deactivate PM
PM -> T : markCompleted()
activate T
note right of T : completed becomes true.
T --> PM
deactivate T
PM --> CH : t
deactivate PM
CH -> UI : showTaskMarked(t)
activate UI
UI --> CH
deactivate UI
CH --> CH
deactivate CH
deactivate CH

@enduml
